e arrangement of non-zero values from the 3x3 input block dictates the corresponding values in the output, which may be a sort of mapping.\n\n\n\n**Confirming Pattern Discovery**\n\nMy initial hypothesis is validated! I've confirmed that the 3x3 block in the input with *no* \"8\" dictates the output. In Example 2, this was block (1,0) and the output was derived directly from its non-zero values. I've successfully identified the key to predicting the outputs by focusing on which blocks lack the color teal, or 8.\n\n\n**Validating the Solution**\n\nI'm now running comprehensive tests on all examples. I have confirmed that the block without the value '8' in the input *precisely* dictates the corresponding output. Example 3 and 4 were perfect! The values from the input block are simply transferred to the output. I'm satisfied that my hypothesis is correct and am proceeding to more tests.\n\n\n",
